# Course planner local SQLite database (per-user accounts + memory).
# Ignore the directory CONTENTS (so user data / app.db stay out of git) but
# allow re-including specific seed/config files below.
project/course_planner/data/*
# ...DO track seed/config data checked into the repo (not user data):
!project/course_planner/data/instructor_ratings.csv
!project/course_planner/data/major_requirements.json
!project/course_planner/data/majors/
!project/course_planner/data/majors/**
